me: this is not a wallet descriptor in any of the four forms `me` reads: a BlueWallet `Key: value` setup file, a plain BIP-380 descriptor, a `{"label":…,"descriptor":…}` JSON export, or a single extended key. It looks most like a plain BIP-380 descriptor, which failed because: the use-site path is not a path: `<2147483648;2147483649>/*`.
